== Walkthrough ==

There is an NPC named Ged Twigborn who wanders the forest. He can usually be spotted in one of two places: Either along the same wall as the zone to the Commonlands, or by turning on the path off the main road from the sign pointing towards Freeport. 

Ged will make you some Wolfskin Gloves if you give him 13 gold and a high quality wolf pelt.

